---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About - Swastik Industries" current="about">
<main><div class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/f36.jpg" alt=""><div class="wrap"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About us</div><h1>Building a strong foundation for a stronger future</h1><p>Incorporated in 2005, with our head office in New Delhi.</p></div></div>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="split"><div class="tx"><div class="eyebrow">About us</div><h2 class="h-2xl">Steel for the infrastructure that society runs on</h2>
<p class="lede">Much of the world around us is made of steel and concrete, and steel is central to sustainability. Swastik Industries was incorporated in India in 2005 with its head office in New Delhi.</p>
<p>Our main objective is to provide high quality industrial products that help develop the economy. We work closely with our clients and give them hands-on support. Our cable trays have gone into prime projects, from metros to telecom towers.</p>
<p>We also provide customised structural steel solutions for the solar, power distribution, electrical transportation and infrastructure industries, made to the customer's requirements, specifications and drawings.</p></div>
<div><img src="/assets/site/chain.jpg" alt="Steel chain links" loading="lazy"></div></div></div></section>
<section class="alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div class="eyebrow">What we work with</div><h2 class="h-xl">Materials and finishes</h2></div>
<div class="matgrid">
<div class="matcard"><h3>Raw materials</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Mild steel</li><li>Pre galvanised sheet</li><li>Stainless steel</li><li>Aluminium</li></ul></div>
<div class="matcard"><h3>Product finish</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Pre galvanised sheet</li><li>Hot dip galvanised</li><li>Powder coated</li><li>Painted</li></ul></div>
</div>
<p class="matnote"><b>ISI marked</b> structural steel or sheet, in various sizes and specifications.</p></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><div class="eyebrow">Why us</div><h2 class="h-xl">What you can expect from us</h2></div>
<div class="whygrid"><div class="whycard"><span class="whyicon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.5"/></svg></span><h3>Quality</h3><p>Committed to excellence, delivering value beyond what is expected.</p></div><div class="whycard"><span class="whyicon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="15" cy="12" r="5"/></svg></span><h3>Relationship</h3><p>Transparent, long term and based on trust.</p></div><div class="whycard"><span class="whyicon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.2"/></svg></span><h3>Customer centricity</h3><p>The client is at the centre of everything we do.</p></div><div class="whycard"><span class="whyicon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20h16M6 20v-5h5v5M13 20V10h5v10M8.5 15v-3"/></svg></span><h3>Strong foundation</h3><p>Delivering to reputed companies across India since 2005.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="alt clients-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><h2 class="h-xl">OUR CLIENTS</h2></div><img class="clients-img" src="/assets/clients/our-clients.png" alt="Our clients: Delhi Metro, Delhi Indira Gandhi International Airport, ETA Engineering, Lanco, Jakson, Amplus Solar, Larsen &amp; Toubro, SAEL, Blue Star, Avaada and Ornate Solar" width="1700" height="350" loading="lazy"></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Send your drawing or bill of quantities</h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Request a quote</a></div></section></main>
</Layout>
